{"data": [{"author_id": "332617373", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:41:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120149746924802535"], "id": "2120149746924802535", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 24, "impression_count": 34481, "like_count": 305, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 23, "retweet_count": 43}, "text": "Monthly US inflation for October came in hotter than expected at both the headline and core levels: 0.4% (versus the consensus forecast of 0.3%) and 0.3% (versus 0.2%), respectively.\nEspecially following Governor Waller’s latest comments, you can set aside any debate over whether", "url": "https://x.com/elerianm/status/2120149746924802535"}, {"author_id": "59603406", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:33:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120147919516885088"], "id": "2120147919516885088", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 45, "impression_count": 103612, "like_count": 577, "quote_count": 25, "reply_count": 52, "retweet_count": 101}, "text": "Core CPI prints at 0.296% in October, the third straight month of a 0.3%. The 3-month annualized rate was 3.75%, up from 1.6% in July.", "url": "https://x.com/NickTimiraos/status/2120147919516885088"}, {"author_id": "612896910", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:31:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120147288828121294"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 80, "start": 72, "tag": "BLSData"}], "urls": [{"description": "The .gov means it's official. Federal government websites often end in .gov or .mil. Before sharing sensitive information, make sure you're on a federal government site. The site is secure. The https:// ensures that you are connecting to the official website and that any information you provide is encrypted and transmitted securely. Transmission of material in this release is embargoed until USDL-26-1686 8:30 a.m. (ET) Tuesday, November 10, 2026 Technical information: (202) 691-6555 * cesinfo@bls.gov *", "display_url": "bls.gov/news.release/a…", "end": 104, "expanded_url": "https://www.bls.gov/news.release/ar