shua_Bengio/status/2120059344259539354"}, {"author_id": "39125788", "created_at": "2026-11-10T03:49:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120000888974766501"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/LUBzuMXFaI", "end": 286, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2120000888974766501/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120000218154373120", "start": 263, "url": "https://t.co/LUBzuMXFaI"}]}, "id": "2120000888974766501", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 386, "impression_count": 88152, "like_count": 1393, "quote_count": 26, "reply_count": 185, "retweet_count": 126}, "text": "Looks like Fable 5.2 is above the already steep trendline on three of the most informative unsaturated benchmarks (ECI is a composite of other benchmarks, Remote Labor measures the ability to do end-to-end freelance jobs, RoboDojo involves controlling robotics). https://t.co/LUBzuMXFaI", "url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2120000888974766501"}, {"author_id": "1214528593", "created_at": "2026-11-10T03:31:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119996405406412980"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/giPrbfsGej", "end": 176, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2119996405406412980/video/1", "media_key": "13_2119995785630900224", "start": 153, "url": "https://t.co/giPrbfsGej"}]}, "id": "2119996405406412980", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 2841, "like_count": 36, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Nice video on the challenge of supervising automated AI R&amp;D - at least somewhat better than Opus 5.5 produces\n\n(Fable 5.2 with ElevenLabs narration) https://t.co/giPrbfsGej", "url": "https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2119996405406412980"}, {"author_id": "332617373", "created_at": "2026-11-10T02:51:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119986182926819622"], "id": "2119986182926819622", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 35, "impression_count": 56305, "like_count": 471, "quote_count": 10, "reply_count": 59, "retweet_count": 63}, "text": "China’s latest trade numbers confirm that the country is on track to exceed its record 2025 trade surplus of $1.2 trillion.\nPowered by a 35.2% annualized growth rate in exports, beating the consensus forecast of 33.5%, China recorded a monthly trade surplus of $105 million in", "url": "https://x.com/elerianm/status/2119986182926819622"}, {"author_id": "279036722", "created_at": "2026-11-10T02:40:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119983430972944625"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/WmTQcaimvq", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/jasonfurman/status/2119983430972944625/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119983329659240448", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/WmTQcaimvq"}, {"display_url": "x.com/econvitals/sta…", "end": 326, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/econvitals/status/2119959455357915480", "start": 303, "url": "https://t.co/JTHiscLKGW"}]}, "id": "2119983430972944625", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 208, "impression_count": 28700, "like_count": 315, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 44}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119959455357915480", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Excited to share this tool--a Macroeconomic simulator that lets you run the Federal Reserve's large macroeconomic model FRB/US.\n\nIt has 13,442 different simulations pre-loaded--different versions of 15 different shocks.\n\nI plan to add more models over time.\n\nHere is a Fed hike. https://t.co/WmTQcaimvq https://t.co/JTHiscLKGW", "url": "https://x.com/jasonfurman/status/2119983430972944625"}, {"author_id": "332617373", "created_at": "2026-11-10T02:25:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119979678010360260"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 61, "start": 53, "tag": "economy"}, {"end": 69, "start": 62, "tag": "nvidia"}, {"end": 78, "start": 70, "tag": "markets"}], "mentions": [{"end": 86, "id": "61559439", "start": 79, "username": "nvidia"}, {"end": 96, "id": "14437914", "start": 87, "username": "NewsHour